WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.508
Oh no!

2
00:00:01.458 --> 00:00:03.264
Too many friends!

3
00:00:03.264 --> 00:00:05.394
Maya's stand can't keep up!

4
00:00:05.394 --> 00:00:08.600
Welcome back to Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

5
00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:10.937
This is Episode 58.

6
00:00:10.937 --> 00:00:12.789
Meet the builder crew.

7
00:00:12.789 --> 00:00:15.208
First, the copy stands.

8
00:00:15.208 --> 00:00:16.782
More friends?

9
00:00:16.782 --> 00:00:18.762
Pop, pop, pop!

10
00:00:18.762 --> 00:00:20.440
More stands.

11
00:00:20.440 --> 00:00:22.118
Fewer friends?

12
00:00:22.118 --> 00:00:23.762
They sink away.

13
00:00:23.762 --> 00:00:25.752
That is Auto Scaling.

14
00:00:25.752 --> 00:00:28.032
Next, the magic bean.

15
00:00:28.032 --> 00:00:31.250
Plant it, and whoosh, a whole stand is ready.

16
00:00:31.250 --> 00:00:33.391
Maya just makes lemonade.

17
00:00:33.391 --> 00:00:35.243
That is Beanstalk.

18
00:00:35.243 --> 00:00:39.792
At night, the night basket squeezes a mountain of lemons while Maya sleeps.

19
00:00:39.792 --> 00:00:41.458
That is Batch.

20
00:00:41.458 --> 00:00:45.579
And the toy shelf keeps the same lunchbox recipe for every stand.

21
00:00:45.579 --> 00:00:47.812
Every cup tastes the same.

22
00:00:47.812 --> 00:00:49.606
That is ECR.

23
00:00:49.606 --> 00:00:52.245
Four helpers, one busy stand.

24
00:00:52.245 --> 00:00:54.363
Now you know the builder crew!

25
00:00:54.363 --> 00:00:57.882
See you next time in Cloud Town, high up in the sky!
